ass=3D"style_problemDescription__T4cPe"><p>Return the <strong>longest palin=
dromic substring</strong> within a given string.</p><h4 id=3D"example">Exam=
ple:</h4><pre><code class=3D"hljs language-python">Input: s =3D <span class=
